<p>You project a powerful blast of magnetic energy from your shield in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 5, 6, 6</acronym> around you. Enemies caught within are knocked back <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 5, 6, 6</acronym> tiles and take <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">200%, 233%, 259%, 280%, 300%</acronym> shield damage as lightning, and any projectiles will be destroyed.</p><p>While this talent is not on cooldown, you also project a magnetic field from your shield, reducing the speed of incoming projectiles by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 26%, 35%, 43%, 50%</acronym> and your chance to be critically hit by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1%, 6%, 9%, 11%, 13%.</acronym></p>